cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or find this work useful, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RPS Observer"
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Jerry
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Ting Yiu
repository-code: https://github.com/folivora-hi/rps_observer
abstract: >
  RPS Observer is an interactive framework for evaluating whether LLMs can demonstrate
  genuine strategic understanding. Using Rock-Paper-Scissors as a controlled testbed,
  the LLM acts as an Observer — watching game rounds and identifying hidden strategies —
  enabling a clean probe of theory-of-mind capabilities. Includes 19 strategies
  (16 static, 3 dynamic), three evaluation metrics (CE, Brier, EV Loss), and a
  unified Union Loss score.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - theory of mind
  - game theory
  - rock paper scissors
  - evaluation framework
  - strategy identification
